// Brood buildings, baked into assets/buildings/brood.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release -- --config assets-src/buildings/brood.ron --out assets/buildings/brood.pak`).
// Each building has four models: its growth stages `#1` (root-veins and resin mound), `#2` (ribcage in a
// membrane cocoon) and `#3` (shell mostly hardened), then the finished building under its own name,
// exactly as in data/rosters. Main-building upgrades (Great Hive, Throne Hive) have only `#3` and the
// finished model. All models of a building share one texture set (one material) and keep their
// authored positions in tiles (`keep_origin`), with the origin at the middle of the footprint on the
// ground and the door facing +z. Sources and scripts: the project's design/buildings/ folder
// (docs/21-buildings.md).
